      ],
      "source": "https://turneroregon.gov/about_turner"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The city of Turner was named in honor of Henry L. Turner, who recorded a town plat at the site in 1871.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://turneroregon.gov/about_turner"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The community of Turner was officially incorporated by the Oregon Legislative Assembly on February 10, 1905.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
